<article class="script-document" aria-labelledby="calling-script-title">
<div class="script-dialog-header"><div><small>TALKVIA · AGENT GUIDE</small><h2 id="calling-script-title">Klu Care calling script · Hinglish</h2></div><span class="badge">India · Sales</span></div>
<div class="script-dialog-body">
<p class="script-intro">Natural conversation rakhein. Brackets mein diye gaye placeholders ki jagah actual details boliye.</p>
<details open><summary>1. Reception / gatekeeper</summary><p>“Namaste, main [Agent Name], Talkvia se baat kar raha/rahi hoon. Klu Care hospital management software ke regarding call kiya hai. Aapke hospital mein software evaluate karne wale administrator, operations manager ya IT manager se baat ho sakti hai?”</p><p><strong>Agar call ka purpose poochhein:</strong> “Hum samajhna chahte hain ki aap hospital ka current software review kar rahe hain ya nahi, aur Klu Care ka demo aapke liye useful hoga ya nahi.”</p><p><strong>Doosra number dein:</strong> “Thank you. Kya main number confirm kar sakta/sakti hoon? Jinse baat karni hai unka naam aur designation bhi bata dijiye, please.”</p><p><strong>Person available na ho:</strong> “Unka naam aur designation bata sakte hain? Unse baat karne ka convenient time kya rahega?”</p></details>
<details open><summary>2. Decision-maker se opening</summary><p>“Namaste [Name], main [Agent Name], Talkvia se hoon. Klu Care hospital management software ke regarding call hai. Kya abhi ek short introduction ke liye baat karna convenient rahega?”</p><p>“Thank you. Pehle main samajhna chahunga/chahungi ki hospital ke daily operations manage karne ke liye aap abhi kaunsa software ya system use kar rahe hain?”</p></details>
<details open><summary>3. Requirements samajhna</summary><p>“Kya current system aapki requirements poori kar raha hai, ya koi area hai jahan improvement chahiye?”</p><p>“Current setup mein aapki team ko sabse zyada difficulty kis cheez mein aati hai?”</p><p>“Kya aap software change karne ka plan kar rahe hain, ya future ke liye options explore karna chahenge?”</p><p><strong>Koi requirement batayein:</strong> “Samajh gaya/gayi. Main ye requirement note kar leta/leti hoon, taaki Klu Care ki team aapke workflow ke hisab se suitability confirm kar sake.”</p></details>
<details open><summary>4. Demo offer aur details confirm karna</summary><p>“Aapki requirements ko dekhte hue, kya aap Klu Care ka demo dekhna chahenge? Demo mein aap software review karke decide kar sakte hain ki ye aapke hospital ke liye suitable hai ya nahi.”</p><p>“Aapke liye kaunsi date aur time convenient rahega? Confirm kar loon—[Date] ko [Time] IST, correct?”</p><p>“Demo details bhejne ke liye aapka full name, designation aur best email address confirm kar dijiye, please.”</p><p>“Kya software evaluate karne mein koi aur person bhi involved hai jise demo mein join karna chahiye?”</p></details>
<details open><summary>5. “Hamare paas already software hai”</summary><p>“Ji, samajh gaya/gayi. Kya wo aapki team ke liye achha work kar raha hai, ya koi requirement hai jo abhi properly cover nahi ho rahi?”</p><p><strong>Current software se satisfied hon:</strong> “Bilkul. Kya future reference ke liye ek short introduction email bhej sakta/sakti hoon?”</p></details>
<details open><summary>6. “Email bhej do” / “Baad mein call karo”</summary><p><strong>Email:</strong> “Ji zaroor. Kis email address par bhejna sahi rahega? Kya koi particular requirement hai jiske baare mein information chahiye? Aap interested hone par contact karna prefer karenge, ya main convenient time par follow-up kar loon?”</p><p><strong>Callback:</strong> “Ji, kaunsi date aur time convenient rahega? Confirm kar loon—[Date], [Time] IST. Kya isi number par aapse directly baat ho jayegi?”</p></details>
<details open><summary>7. Pricing, features aur integrations</summary><p><strong>Pricing:</strong> “Main aapko galat pricing nahi batana chahunga/chahungi. Aapki requirements ke hisab se Klu Care ki team exact pricing confirm kar degi. Aap email par details chahenge ya discussion ke time?”</p><p><strong>Feature / integration / compliance:</strong> “Main aapka question note kar leta/leti hoon aur product team se accurate confirmation dilwa dunga/dungi. Aapki exact requirement thodi explain kar sakte hain?”</p></details>
<details open><summary>8. Not interested / do not call</summary><p><strong>Not interested:</strong> “Ji, samajh gaya/gayi. Aapke time ke liye thank you. Aapka din achha rahe.”</p><p><strong>Do not call:</strong> “Ji, main aapki further calls na karne ki request record kar leta/leti hoon. Thank you.”</p></details>
<details open><summary>9. Confirm karke call close karna</summary><p>“Thank you, [Name]. Confirm kar loon—aapki main requirement [Requirement] hai, aur next step [Demo / Email / Callback] hai, [Date] ko [Time] IST. Aapka email [Email Address] hai. Kya ye details correct hain? Aapke time ke liye thank you.”</p></details>
<details open><summary>10. Voicemail</summary><p>“Namaste [Name], main [Agent Name], Talkvia se hoon. Klu Care hospital management software ke regarding call kiya tha. Hum aapki requirements samajhkar discuss karna chahenge ki demo useful rahega ya nahi. Aap humein [Approved Callback Number] par contact kar sakte hain. Thank you.”</p></details>
<div class="script-agent-note"><strong>Har call ke baad</strong><p>Number dialed, source name, designation, notes aur outcome save karein. Referral par Referred to Another Number select karein aur naya number Callback number mein daalein. Number dialed mein abhi call kiya hua number hi rakhein. Isi hospital mein agla call karna ho to Save call &amp; stay; final call ke baad Dispose &amp; next hospital use karein. Callback/demo hospital ke local timezone mein set karein; India hospital ke liye IST confirm karein. Features, pricing ya compliance ke baare mein sirf confirmed information dein.</p></div>
</div></article>
